00:03:54.099 --> 00:03:55.900
Hello everyone, my name is Wu Xueqing.

00:03:55.939 --> 00:03:57.460
I'm a student at Shenzhen University.

00:03:57.699 --> 00:03:59.139
I'm also Teacher Wang's teaching assistant.

00:03:59.219 --> 00:03:59.860
Welcome, everyone,

00:03:59.860 --> 00:04:01.539
to Xinghui Night School to learn English.

00:04:01.860 --> 00:04:03.219
Before we start class,

00:04:03.219 --> 00:04:04.939
I'd like to ask you a few questions.

00:04:04.939 --> 00:04:05.539
This way, everyone can

00:04:05.539 --> 00:04:06.580
get to know each other.

00:04:06.860 --> 00:04:08.379
Why do you want to learn English?

00:04:09.060 --> 00:04:10.500
I'm in the clothing business.

00:04:10.500 --> 00:04:12.419
Many foreigners come to buy clothes.

00:04:12.580 --> 00:04:13.699
If I learn English well,

00:04:13.699 --> 00:04:14.979
business will be better.

00:04:16.100 --> 00:04:16.980
I'm a tour guide.

00:04:16.980 --> 00:04:18.139
I lead tours for Hong Kong, China groups.

00:04:18.339 --> 00:04:18.860
I usually

00:04:18.860 --> 00:04:20.420
deal with many overseas tourists.

00:04:20.740 --> 00:04:21.779
They give good tips.

00:04:21.779 --> 00:04:22.379
You earn money faster.

00:04:22.899 --> 00:04:23.740
I, uh...

00:04:24.060 --> 00:04:26.259
I sell mobile phones at Huaqiangbei.

00:04:26.259 --> 00:04:27.139
And pagers.

00:04:27.220 --> 00:04:29.220
I source goods directly from foreigners,

00:04:30.019 --> 00:04:31.500
to avoid middlemen taking a cut.

00:04:33.540 --> 00:04:34.459
I'm from Macau, China.

00:04:34.899 --> 00:04:35.819
The handover is coming soon.

00:04:36.259 --> 00:04:36.980
The Macau, China Tourism Office

00:04:36.980 --> 00:04:38.100
