You never know

00:10:27.779 --> 00:10:31.899
what hand you're gonna get dealt next.

00:10:32.259 --> 00:10:35.259
You learn to take life

00:10:36.019 --> 00:10:38.500
and make every day meaningful.

00:10:38.899 --> 00:10:40.899
Your spoken English has improved by leaps and bounds.

00:10:42.220 --> 00:10:43.379
The teacher is good.

00:10:45.779 --> 00:10:46.899
It's a pity this teacher of yours

00:10:46.899 --> 00:10:47.899
won't be teaching for much longer.

00:10:48.299 --> 00:10:49.139
Why?

00:10:50.019 --> 00:10:50.899
Being a teaching assistant here

00:10:50.899 --> 00:10:52.259
was just a part-time job anyway.

00:10:52.620 --> 00:10:54.139
I applied to New York University

00:10:54.139 --> 00:10:55.379
for a master's in anthropology.

00:11:02.500 --> 00:11:03.139
Haitian.

00:11:03.779 --> 00:11:04.659
Have you ever thought about

00:11:04.980 --> 00:11:06.659
going out into the wider world,

00:11:06.740 --> 00:11:07.620
to take a look?

00:11:13.539 --> 00:11:14.899
The world out there is vast.

00:11:15.379 --> 00:11:17.379
I think while we're young,

00:11:17.659 --> 00:11:19.179
we can bravely go out and explore.

00:11:21.659 --> 00:11:23.179
During my time at the night school,

00:11:23.740 --> 00:11:25.019
I've met many friends.

00:11:25.860 --> 00:11:27.139
What moved me most is that,

00:11:27.659 --> 00:11:29.379
no matter their profession,

00:11:29.899 --> 00:11:32.259
